<title>INDIA: India Hindalco 4-mth metal output rises.</title>
<headline>India Hindalco 4-mth metal output rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's leading private aluminium maker Hindalco Industries Ltd said its primary metal production in the first four months of 1997/98 (April-March) rose 21 percent compared to the year ago period.</p>
<p>It said its sales were up 26 percent during the same period.  </p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
